<title>KENYA: Kidnapped American released in Somalia.</title>
<headline>Kidnapped American released in Somalia.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somali gunmen released on Wednesday an American working for the U.S. Aid for International Development (USAID), a spokesman at the U.S. embassy in Nairobi said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said that Daniel Suther, seized by more than eight gunmen in north Mogadishu on Tuesday, was set free on Wednesday morning. He had no further details.</p>
</text>
